## pyramid-hierarchical (expand the pyramid's terms, then sum them, each in an operator
## implementation substate) under the world conventions (the shared library, no external environment:
## ^environment none).

## Shared Soar library (Soar/soar-library, v2.32); the path assumes this folder is in Tasks/Families/<family>/world/<variant>
pushd "../../../../../Soar/soar-library"
source soar-library.soar
popd

chunk never
multi-attributes object 2
multi-attributes term 1

source pyramid-hierarchical-world.soar
source expand-pyramid.soar
source sum-terms.soar
